<title>UK: Paribas leads $125 mln five-year asset-backed FRN.</title>
<headline>Paribas leads $125 mln five-year asset-backed FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas has lead-managed a $125 million asset-backed FRN for Paragon International Notes Series 1997A.  </p>
<p> BORROWER   PARAGON INTERNATIONAL NOTES SERIES 1997A</p>
<p> AMT    $125 MLN	SPREAD     20 BP     MATURITY    20.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   17.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO</p>
<p> FORCE MAJ  NO	  GOV LAW    NEW YORK</p>
<p> NOTES	THE NOTES ARE BACKED BY A GUARANTEED INVESTMENT</p>
<p>		CONTRACT ISSUED BY SUNaMERICA LIFE INSURANCE COMPANY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
